Package: finalproject
Title: Public Health Data for the BST260 Final Project
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person("Yibing (Janice)", "Jiang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "141768352+yibingjiang@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Provides public health datasets used in the BST260 final project.
    The data cover foodborne and waterborne outbreaks, homicide and firearm
    mortality, and state firearm legislation. The accompanying documentation
    describes the datasets and their sources.
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, pkgdown, quarto
License: Artistic-2.0
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://yibingjiang.github.io/finalproject/,
    https://github.com/yibingjiang/finalproject
BugReports: https://github.com/yibingjiang/finalproject/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Roxygen: list(markdown=TRUE)
